      "source": "Ng 2022 SII B p.2 (interval = 29.09733(4) GHz); Ng thesis S4.1.1 p.78",
      "status": "estimate",
      "isotopologue": "229Th19F+",
      "convention": null,
      "note": "Transferred unchanged from 232Th19F+ to 229Th19F+; not measured for the target isotope and not mass-scaled. Source-isotope uncertainty: 0.01 MHz; target-isotope transfer uncertainty is unquantified. Interval/4 approximation, not a refit with D0 and extra hyperfine terms. Propagated measurement uncertainty is 0.010 MHz. With the current B J(J+1)-D[J(J+1)]^2 terms, the rotational interval is 4B-32D, 124.704 kHz below the source interval; a consistent refit is unresolved"
    },
